Package: vcfTargetVariantMapper.multitrait
Type: Dependency manifest
Title: R Dependencies for vcf-target-variant-mapper v2.0 Multitrait Gene Discovery
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("vcf-target-variant-mapper", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Declares the R package dependencies for the modules/multitrait_gene_discovery
    pipeline (run_coloc.R). Install order matters: RcppEigen is PINNED to 0.3.3.9.3
    for hyprcoloc (jrs95/hyprcoloc) compatibility. Colocalization engines:
    colocboost (StatFunGen/colocboost) as primary, HyPrColoc (jrs95/hyprcoloc) as
    backup, POEMColoc for truncated/top-SNP data degradation path.
License: MIT
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    yaml (>= 2.3),
    data.table
Suggests:
    coloc (>= 6.0),
    susieR,
    remotes,
    Rcpp,
    Matrix,
    Rmpfr,
    iterpc,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    pheatmap,
    RColorBrewer
Encoding: UTF-8
Additional_repositories: https://github.com/StatFunGen/colocboost, https://github.com/jrs95/hyprcoloc
X-RcppEigen-Pin: 0.3.3.9.3
X-Install-Notes: |
  # 1) 锁定 RcppEigen 版本（hyprcoloc 编译要求 0.3.3.9.3；不影响 colocboost/susieR/coloc/POEMColoc）
  remotes::install_version("RcppEigen", version = "0.3.3.9.3",
                           repos = "https://cran.r-project.org")
  # 2) 共定位引擎（按需）
  remotes::install_github("StatFunGen/colocboost")        # 主引擎
  remotes::install_github("jrs95/hyprcoloc", upgrade = "never")   # 备选（RcppEigen 0.3.3.9.3）
  BiocManager::install(c("SeqArray", "SeqVarTools"))      # POEMColoc 前置
  remotes::install_github("AbbVie-ComputationalGenomics/POEMColoc")
  install.packages(c("coloc", "susieR", "yaml"))
